    "detailed_description": "ReThink 5 is a first person puzzle game in a peaceful futuristic setting, that features a variety of Puzzles that utilize Lasers and the behavior of light and it's colors to create challenging problems to solve.<br><br>Use newly added and already proven gameplay mechanics to puzzle your way through the game's beautiful world, which is now filled with even more puzzles than in previous games.<br><br>ReThink 5 features more than 50 Puzzles that make use of newly introduced features and old ones alike, to keep the gears in your head turning.<br><br>All puzzles follow the same set of rules, but often come with a twist that will make you think about your solution, and often rethink it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improvements over ReThink 4:</h2><br>- Adjusted and smoothed difficulty progression<br>- New features and puzzle elements<br>- Improved performance<br>- Enhanced Soundtrack<br><br>The game also comes with many more changes and improvements (large and small) that allow for a more dynamic game and more interactive puzzles.",
